  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## New Version\n* Bump `net_conduit` from `1.0.1` to `1.1.2`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit/1.0.1...net_conduit/1.1.2)\n\n## What's Changed\n* Use conditional references for NetConduit dependency by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/20\n* Bump xunit.runner.visualstudio from 2.8.2 to 3.1.5 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/18\n* Bump Nuke.Common from 10.0.0 to 10.1.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/15\n* Bump Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk from 17.12.0 to 18.0.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/14\n* Bump coverlet.collector from 6.0.2 to 6.0.4 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/12\n* Bump xunit from 2.9.2 to 2.9.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/16\n* Bump xunit.runner.visualstudio from 3.0.2 to 3.1.5 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/22\n* Introduce adaptive flow control for improved performance by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/23\n* Bump BenchmarkDotNet from 0.14.0 to 0.15.8 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/11\n* Bump Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk from 17.14.0 to 18.0.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/21\n\n## New Contributors\n* @dependabot[bot] made their first contribution in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/18\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/build.20251204190256.4f8d5d6...build.20251204221330.f94a1db",
